<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Pray</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>pray
pray statue
</pre>
<p>There is no prayer that works everywhere: you pray where something is 
listening.
</p>
<ul><li><b>Odin's statue</b>, in the temple of Udgaard and the Cathedral of Midgaard: pray statue, and if you are of level 20 or below, Odin gives you a beginner's gear (see <a cmd='#'>Help Odin Statue</a>).</li>
<li><b>The healers' silver torc</b>, the guild item of the Healers: wear it at your neck and pray, and it forms a hammer of light in your hand, at the cost of some mana.</li>
<li><b>The Bounty Hunters</b> have a chapel where their recruits pray (see <a cmd='#'>Help Bounty</a>).</li></ul>
<p>Elsewhere the game won't understand you.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Odin Statue</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Healers</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bounty</a>
</pre>




</div>